# PureBlog Project Rules

## Scope
This repository is a modular-monolith blog project used to showcase backend engineering capability.

## Mandatory constraints
- Follow docs under `/docs`
- Keep database table prefix as `pb_`
- Do not split into microservices in phase 1
- Use Java 17 + Spring Boot 3 + MyBatis-Plus
- Use Redis for cache/counters, Kafka for async side effects, Elasticsearch for search
- Do not introduce Dubbo in phase 1 unless explicitly requested
- Output complete files, not partial snippets
- Keep controller thin, business logic in service/manager
- Keep DTO/VO/DO separated
- Update SQL/doc if schema changes

## Code style
- Use clear package boundaries
- Use Validation for request params
- Use unified ApiResponse
- Use unified GlobalExceptionHandler
- Use transaction only on write operations
- Use XML for complex queries when MyBatis-Plus is not enough

## Review expectations
When generating code, always state:
1. which files changed
2. whether DB changed
3. how to test
4. what to do next
